Add-R '1603q-validate-014' 'validate' 14 'All previous rules pass.' @('frm1603Q:cmdValidate') 'Validation successful. Click on Edit if you wish to modify your entries.' 'official-hta-runtime#validateForm:L2911-L2920' 'verified-correct' 'Disables controls and enables Edit, Print, upload and Final Copy.' 'Use an explicit validated state invalidated by edits.'
Add-R '1603q-save-001' 'save' 1 'No quarter is selected.' @('quarter-fields') 'Please select quarter on Item 2.' 'official-hta-runtime#initialValidateBeforeSave:L3185-L3191'
